# Crib Swap exiles, it does not destroy: Bot1 aims it at Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot2 responds with Valorous Stance (Mox Pearl and
# Mox Ruby), giving it indestructible. The Ornithopter is exiled all the same and Bot2, its controller, gets the Shapeshifter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Crib Swap
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Valorous Stance
Island x16

